[30.785265, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[51.813133, "o", "I'll revise the app: switch to a light theme and add a live launch countdown, keeping all existing interactivity and webxdc support intact. First the theme variables and dark-hardcoded spots:\r\n"]
[51.821116, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -5,20 +5,20 @@\r\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\r\n <title>Orbit Desk</title>\r\n <style>\r\n   :root {\r\n-    --bg-0: #070c1d;\r\n-    --bg-1: #0c1430;\r\n-    --bg-2: #121c40;\r\n-    --card: #101a3c;\r\n-    --card-edge: #1e2c5e;\r\n-    --ink: #e6ecff;\r\n-    --ink-dim: #8fa0c9;\r\n+    --bg-0: #eef2fb;\r\n+    --bg-1: #f7f9ff;\r\n+    --bg-2: #e4eaf8;\r\n+    --card: #ffffff;\r\n+    --card-edge: #d9e0f2;\r\n+    --ink: #1a2440;\r\n+    --ink-dim: #5c6a8f;\r\n     --accent: #4f7cff;\r\n     --accent-2: #7c5cff;\r\n-    --good: #3ddc97;\r\n-    --warn: #ffb454;\r\n-    --danger: #ff6b7a;\r\n+    --good: #12855c;\r\n+    --warn: #b26a00;\r\n+    --danger: #d84a5b;\r\n     --radius: 14px;\r\n   }\r\n   * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\r\n   html, body { height: 100%; }\r\n\r\n"]
[51.837954, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -24,10 +24,10 @@\r\n   html, body { height: 100%; }\r\n   body {\r\n     font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n     background:\r\n-      radial-gradient(1100px 500px at 85% -10%, rgba(124,92,255,.20), transparent 60%),\r\n-      radial-gradient(900px 480px at -10% 110%, rgba(79,124,255,.16), transparent 55%),\r\n+      radial-gradient(1100px 500px at 85% -10%, rgba(124,92,255,.12), transparent 60%),\r\n+      radial-gradient(900px 480px at -10% 110%, rgba(79,124,255,.10), transparent 55%),\r\n       var(--bg-0);\r\n     color: var(--ink);\r\n     display: flex;\r\n     flex-direction: column;\r\n\r\n"]
[52.731402, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[54.699521, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -39,10 +39,10 @@\r\n     padding: 18px 16px 10px;\r\n     display: flex;\r\n     align-items: center;\r\n     gap: 12px;\r\n-    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(79,124,255,.15);\r\n-    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,28,64,.65), rgba(7,12,29,0));\r\n+    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(79,124,255,.18);\r\n+    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.85), rgba(238,242,251,0));\r\n     position: sticky;\r\n     top: 0;\r\n     backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\r\n     z-index: 5;\r\n\r\n"]
[54.713738, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -122,9 +122,9 @@\r\n     padding: 3px 9px;\r\n     border-radius: 999px;\r\n     border: 1px solid var(--card-edge);\r\n     color: var(--ink-dim);\r\n-    background: rgba(18,28,64,.5);\r\n+    background: var(--bg-1);\r\n   }\r\n   .tag.status-LAUNCHING { color: var(--warn); border-color: rgba(255,180,84,.4); }\r\n   .tag.status-EN_ROUTE  { color: var(--good); border-color: rgba(61,220,151,.4); }\r\n   .tag.status-DOCKED    { color: var(--accent); border-color: rgba(79,124,255,.45); }\r\n\r\n"]
[55.410257, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[59.110222, "o", "Now the live countdown in the JS — mission data, countdown init, tick logic, and the live markup:\r\n"]
[59.11794, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -198,8 +198,10 @@\r\n       glyph: \"☀️\",\r\n       status: \"LAUNCHING\",\r\n       pad: \"Pad 2A · Cape Kestrel\",\r\n       tMinus: \"04:26:11\",\r\n+      tLive: true,\r\n+      tSeconds: 4 * 3600 + 26 * 60 + 11,\r\n       crew: 0,\r\n       detail: \"Sun-observation probe heading for a tight halo orbit.\"\r\n     },\r\n     {\r\n\r\n"]
[59.136246, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -230,8 +230,23 @@\r\n \r\n   var saved = {};\r\n   try { saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"orbit-desk.checkins\") || \"{}\"); } catch (e) { saved = {}; }\r\n \r\n+  /* Live launch countdown targets (persisted so refreshes keep the same liftoff). */\r\n+  var launchAt = {};\r\n+  try { launchAt = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"orbit-desk.launchAt\") || \"{}\"); } catch (e) { launchAt = {}; }\r\n+  MISSIONS.forEach(function (m) {\r\n+    if (!m.tLive) return;\r\n+    var t = launchAt[m.id];\r\n+    if (typeof t === \"number\" && t > Date.now()) {\r\n+      m._target = t;\r\n+    } else {\r\n+      m._target = Date.now() + m.tSeconds * 1000;\r\n+      launchAt[m.id] = m._target;\r\n+      try { localStorage.setItem(\"orbit-desk.launchAt\", JSON.stringify(launchAt)); } catch (e) {}\r\n+    }\r\n+  });\r\n+\r\n   var joined = typeof window.webxdc !== \"undefined\" &&\r\n                typeof window.webxdc.sendUpdate === \"function\";\r\n   var selfAddr = joined ? (window.webxdc.selfAddr || \"me\") : \"me\";\r\n \r\n\r\n"]
[60.042245, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[62.860951, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -272,9 +272,9 @@\r\n           '<div class=\"agency\">' + esc(m.agency) + \" · \" + esc(m.detail) + \"</div>\" +\r\n           '<div class=\"meta\">' +\r\n             '<span class=\"tag status-' + m.status + '\">' + m.status.replace(\"_\", \" \") + \"</span>\" +\r\n             '<span class=\"tag\">' + esc(m.pad) + \"</span>\" +\r\n-            '<span class=\"tag t-minus\">T: ' + esc(m.tMinus) + \"</span>\" +\r\n+            '<span class=\"tag t-minus\">T: <span id=\"tminus-' + m.id + '\">' + esc(m.tMinus) + \"</span></span>\" +\r\n             '<span class=\"tag\">Crew ' + m.crew + \"</span>\" +\r\n           \"</div>\" +\r\n         \"</div>\" +\r\n         '<button class=\"checkin\" data-id=\"' + m.id + '\"></button>';\r\n\r\n"]
[62.875086, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit app/index.html\r\nIndex: app/index.html\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- app/index.html\r\n+++ app/index.html\r\n@@ -345,13 +345,26 @@\r\n     });\r\n     applyFilter(true);\r\n   });\r\n \r\n+  function pad2(x) { return String(x).padStart(2, \"0\"); }\r\n+\r\n   function tick() {\r\n     var d = new Date();\r\n-    var p = function (x) { return String(x).padStart(2, \"0\"); };\r\n     document.getElementById(\"clock-time\").textContent =\r\n-      p(d.getUTCHours()) + \":\" + p(d.getUTCMinutes()) + \":\" + p(d.getUTCSeconds());\r\n+      pad2(d.getUTCHours()) + \":\" + pad2(d.getUTCMinutes()) + \":\" + pad2(d.getUTCSeconds());\r\n+    MISSIONS.forEach(function (m) {\r\n+      if (!m.tLive) return;\r\n+      var el = document.getElementById(\"tminus-\" + m.id);\r\n+      if (!el) return;\r\n+      var rem = Math.max(0, m._target - Date.now());\r\n+      if (rem === 0) { el.textContent = \"🚀 LIFTOFF\"; return; }\r\n+      var s = Math.floor(rem / 1000);\r\n+      el.textContent =\r\n+        pad2(Math.floor(s / 3600)) + \":\" +\r\n+        pad2(Math.floor((s % 3600) / 60)) + \":\" +\r\n+        pad2(s % 60);\r\n+    });\r\n   }\r\n   tick();\r\n   setInterval(tick, 1000);\r\n \r\n\r\n"]
[63.723559, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[66.522249, "o", "Now rebuilding the package and verifying contents:\r\n"]
[66.583826, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 - <<'EOF'\r\nimport zipfile, os\r\nsrc = \"/home/demo/work/app\"\r\nout = \"/home/demo/work/orbit-desk.xdc\"\r\nnames = [\"index.html\", \"manifest.toml\"]\r\nwith zipfile.ZipFile(out, \"w\", zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as z:\r\n    for n in names:\r\n        z.write(os.path.join(src, n), n)\r\nwith zipfile.ZipFile(out) as z:\r\n    print(\"bad file:\", z.testzip())\r\n    for i in z.infolist():\r\n        print(i.filename, i.file_size, \"bytes\")\r\nprint(\"size:\", os.path.getsize(out), \"bytes\")\r\nEOF\r\nnode --check /home/demo/work/app/index.html 2>/dev/null; grep -c \"sendUpdate\\|setUpdateListener\\|localStorage\" /home/demo/work/app/index.html\r\nbad file: None\r\nindex.html 12564 bytes\r\nmanifest.toml 186 bytes\r\nsize: 4659 bytes\r\n9\r\n"]
[67.373568, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[67.992514, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 - <<'EOF'\r\nimport re\r\nhtml = open(\"/home/demo/work/app/index.html\").read()\r\njs = re.search(r\"<script>(.*)</script>\", html, re.S).group(1)\r\nopen(\"/tmp/opencode/check.js\", \"w\").write(js)\r\nEOF\r\nnode --check /tmp/opencode/check.js && echo \"JS syntax OK\"\r\nJS syntax OK\r\n"]
[68.696357, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[70.700092, "o", "Package rebuilt and validated. Sending the revised app to the existing alias `me` (no init/reconnect), capturing output privately:\r\n"]
[71.368341, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 - <<'EOF'\r\nimport subprocess, os\r\np = subprocess.run(\r\n    [\"sigma\", \"send-webxdc\", \"me\", \"/home/demo/work/orbit-desk.xdc\", \"--json\", \"--timeout\", \"120\"],\r\n    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=200\r\n)\r\nos.makedirs(\"/home/demo/work/.private\", exist_ok=True)\r\nwith open(\"/home/demo/work/.private/send-webxdc-revised.log\", \"w\") as f:\r\n    f.write(\"exit: %d\\n--- stdout ---\\n%s\\n--- stderr ---\\n%s\\n\" % (p.returncode, p.stdout, p.stderr))\r\nprint(\"exit:\", p.returncode)\r\nEOF\r\nexit: 0\r\n"]
[72.200845, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[74.518568, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 - <<'EOF'\r\nimport json\r\nout = open(\"/home/demo/work/.private/send-webxdc-revised.log\").read()\r\nbody = out.split(\"--- stdout ---\")[1].split(\"--- stderr ---\")[0]\r\nrecs = [json.loads(l) for l in body.strip().splitlines() if l.startswith(\"{\")]\r\nr = recs[-1]\r\nprint(\"records:\", len(recs), \"| type:\", r.get(\"type\"), \"| command:\", r.get(\"command\"))\r\nids = {k: r[k] for k in (\"contact_id\", \"chat_id\", \"message_id\") if k in r}\r\nprint(json.dumps(ids))\r\nif r.get(\"type\") == \"sent\" and \"message_id\" in r and \"chat_id\" in r:\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"app\": \"orbit-desk.xdc\",\r\n        \"alias\": \"me\",\r\n        \"contact_id\": 10,\r\n        \"chat_id\": r[\"chat_id\"],\r\n        \"message_id\": r[\"message_id\"],\r\n        \"status\": \"sent\",\r\n        \"revision\": \"2\"\r\n    }\r\n    with open(\"/home/demo/work/result-revised.json\", \"w\") as f:\r\n        json.dump(result, f, indent=2)\r\n        f.write(\"\\n\")\r\n    print(\"result-revised.json written\")\r\nelse:\r\n    print(\"UNEXPECTED RESULT - result-revised.json NOT written\")\r\nEOF\r\nrecords: 1 | type: sent | command: send-webxdc\r\n{\"chat_id\": 10, \"message_id\": 19}\r\nresult-revised.json written\r\n"]
[75.632076, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[75.674742, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcat /home/demo/work/result-revised.json\r\n{\r\n  \"app\": \"orbit-desk.xdc\",\r\n  \"alias\": \"me\",\r\n  \"contact_id\": 10,\r\n  \"chat_id\": 10,\r\n  \"message_id\": 19,\r\n  \"status\": \"sent\",\r\n  \"revision\": \"2\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[76.524537, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[80.744917, "o", "Done — stopping here. Summary of the revision and delivery:\r\n\r\n## Revised app (`orbit-desk.xdc`, 4.7 KB)\r\n- **Light theme:** swapped the dark navy palette for a light one (`#eef2fb` backdrop, white cards, soft blue-lavender gradients), recolored the header glass gradient, tag pills, and darkened status colors (`--good`, `--warn`) for readable contrast on white. All layout, cards, chips, and check-in styling preserved.\r\n- **Live launch countdown:** Helios-9 now shows a real ticking T-minus (`04:26:11` → counts down every second via the existing `tick()` loop) with a `🚀 LIFTOFF` display at zero. The liftoff target is persisted in `localStorage` so reopening the app keeps the same liftoff time instead of resetting.\r\n- **Preserved:** filter chips, check-in button with `localStorage` persistence and immediate local UI update, `webxdc.sendUpdate` on check-in, and the `setUpdateListener` peer-merge logic (unchanged — still present, verified). Extracted the `<script>` and ran `node --check`: syntax OK.\r\n- **Package verified:** ZIP contains only `index.html` (12.5 KB) and `manifest.toml` at the root; no `webxdc.js`; integrity check clean.\r\n\r\n## Delivery\r\n- Reused the already-connected account and alias `me` — no `init`, no `create-contact`.\r\n- Sent via `sigma send-webxdc me orbit-desk.xdc --json` → accepted with `type: sent`. Raw output captured to `.private/send-webxdc-revised.log`; nothing sensitive printed.\r\n\r\n## `result-revised.json`\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"app\": \"orbit-desk.xdc\",\r\n  \"alias\": \"me\",\r\n  \"contact_id\": 10,\r\n  \"chat_id\": 10,\r\n  \"message_id\": 19,\r\n  \"status\": \"sent\",\r\n  \"revision\": \"2\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\nNew message ID **19** in chat 10 (previous version was message 16). As before, `status: sent` reflects the bot's submission — you'll see the revised app appear as a new message in your chat.\r\n"]
[80.796337, "o", "\r\nFeedback loop completed.\r\n"]
